---
Narrator: |typewriter|打字机环节，4 个方向键 QTE。
-> 完美输入，无失误
    <<set $Route_QTEErrorCount = 0>>
    <<jump C2_D155>>
-> 出现一次失误
    <<set $Route_QTEErrorCount = 1>>
    <<jump C2_D155>>
-> 出现两次失误
