title: ITC_Client2_PostContract
---
<<jump C3_D252>>
===

title: ITC_Day1_MoreClients
---
Narrator: |fade|DAY 1 其余客户待扩展，包括巴塞洛缪 沙利文与瑞吉 威克斯等。
Narrator: |fade|可沿用当前客户流程模板补全后续客户节点。
<<jump ITC_Act4_EndingEntry>>
===

title: ITC_Day2_ClientSequence
---
Narrator: |fade|DAY 2 客户序列占位节点。后续在此接入新客户组。
<<jump ITC_Act4_EndingEntry>>
===

title: ITC_Day3Plus_ClientSequence
---
Narrator: |fade|DAY 3 及之后客户序列占位节点。后续在此接入长期循环内容。
<<jump ITC_Act4_EndingEntry>>
===

title: C2_D146
---
<<if $Route_CurrentClient == 1>>
    <<if $Route_StampType != "事件">>
        <<set $Sign_mistake = 1>>
        <<set $satisfaction = $satisfaction - 1>>
        Narrator: |typewriter|<shake a=0.45>印章选择错误</shake>。本客户应选择事件类印章。
    <<else>>
        Narrator: |typewriter|<wave s=0.7>印章选择正确</wave>。
    <<endif>>
    <<jump ITC_Client1_SoulInput>>
<<else>>
    <<if $Route_CurrentClient == 2>>
        <<if $Route_StampType != "特技">>
            <<set $Sign_mistake = 1>>
            <<set $satisfaction = $satisfaction - 1>>
            Narrator: |typewriter|<shake a=0.45>印章选择错误</shake>。本客户应选择特技类印章。
        <<else>>
            Narrator: |typewriter|<wave s=0.7>印章选择正确</wave>。
        <<endif>>
        <<jump ITC_Client2_SoulInput>>
    <<else>>
        Narrator: |typewriter|<wiggle s=0.7>未识别的客户路由</wiggle>。
        <<jump ITC_Act4_EndingEntry>>
    <<endif>>
<<endif>>
===

title: C2_D155
---
<<if $Route_QTEErrorCount >= 3>>
    <<set $Sign_mistake = 1>>
    Narrator: |typewriter|<shake a=0.55>打字机环节严重失误，签约判定失败。</shake>
<<else>>
    <<if $Route_QTEErrorCount == 2>>
        <<set $satisfaction = $satisfaction - 1>>
        Narrator: |typewriter|打字机环节二次失误，客户满意度下降。
    <<endif>>
<<endif>>
<<if $Route_CurrentClient == 1>>
    <<jump ITC_Client1_StampInput>>
<<else>>
    <<if $Route_CurrentClient == 2>>
        <<jump ITC_Client2_StampInput>>
    <<else>>
        <<jump ITC_Act4_EndingEntry>>
    <<endif>>
<<endif>>
===

title: C3_D176
---
<<if $Route_SoulCollectPercent < $Route_SoulMin>>
    <<set $Sign_mistake = 1>>
    Narrator: |typewriter|<shake a=0.55>灵魂收取过少，签约判定失败。</shake>
<<else>>
    <<if $Route_SoulCollectPercent > $Route_SoulMax>>
        <<set $satisfaction = $satisfaction - 1>>
        Narrator: |typewriter|灵魂收取过多，客户满意度下降。
    <<else>>
        Narrator: |typewriter|<wave s=0.7>灵魂收取比例正确</wave>。
    <<endif>>
<<endif>>
<<if $Route_CurrentClient == 1>>
    <<jump ITC_Client1_PostContract>>
<<else>>
    <<if $Route_CurrentClient == 2>>
        <<jump ITC_Client2_PostContract>>
    <<else>>
        <<jump ITC_Act4_EndingEntry>>
    <<endif>>
<<endif>>
===

title: C3_D252
---
<<if $Sign_mistake == 1>>
    <<set $Nmber_of_sign_mistake = $Nmber_of_sign_mistake + 1>>
    <<set $Global_sign_mistake = $Global_sign_mistake + 1>>
<<endif>>
<<if $Route_CurrentClient == 1>>
    <<if $Sign_mistake == 1>>
        Henet: |fade|<incr>蠢货</incr>。你刚刚那次签约失误我已经看到了。再来两次，你就滚出 ITC。
    <<else>>
        <<if $satisfaction >= 3>>
            Henet: |fade|不错。你的第一份契约处理得还算顺利。继续保持。
        <<else>>
            Henet: |fade|契约算是完成了，但你的服务质量远不够看。
        <<endif>>
    <<endif>>
    <<jump ITC_Client2_Thomas_Intro>>
<<else>>
    <<if $Route_CurrentClient == 2>>
        <<if $Sign_mistake == 1>>
            Henet: |fade|第二份契约出现失误。记住，你的试工名额不是无限的。
        <<else>>
            <<if $satisfaction >= 3>>
                Henet: |fade|这份契约处理得不错。继续工作。
            <<else>>
                Henet: |fade|勉强合格。别让低满意度成为常态。
            <<endif>>
        <<endif>>
        <<jump ITC_Day1_MoreClients>>
    <<else>>
        <<jump ITC_Act4_EndingEntry>>
    <<endif>>
<<endif>>
===

title: ITC_Act4_EndingEntry
---
Narrator: |typewriter|结局判定中。累计签约失误 {$Nmber_of_sign_mistake}，当前 DAY {$DAY}。
<<if $Nmber_of_sign_mistake >= 3>>
    <<jump ITC_Ending_Fired>>
<<else>>
    <<if $DAY >= 13>>
        <<jump ITC_Ending_TrialComplete>>
    <<else>>
        <<if $HiddenEndingTrigger>>
            <<jump ITC_Ending_Hidden>>
        <<else>>
            <<jump ITC_Act5_AfterWork>>
        <<endif>>
    <<endif>>
<<endif>>
===

title: ITC_Ending_Fired
---
<<set $Sys_IsGameFinished = true>>
<<set $Sys_CurrentPhase = "Ending_Fired">>
Narrator: |fade|由于累计签约失误达到 3 次，Barks 被 ITC 解雇。
Henet: |fade|你已经证明自己不适合这份工作。离开我的公司。
<<stop>>
===

title: ITC_Ending_TrialComplete
---
<<set $Sys_IsGameFinished = true>>
<<set $Sys_CurrentPhase = "Ending_TrialComplete">>
Narrator: |fade|13 天试工期结束。Barks 将迎来去留判定。
Narrator: |fade|正式结局内容待后续补全。
<<stop>>
===

title: ITC_Ending_Hidden
---
<<set $Sys_IsGameFinished = true>>
<<set $Sys_CurrentPhase = "Ending_Hidden">>
Narrator: |fade|触发特殊条件，进入隐藏结局。
Narrator: |fade|隐藏结局文本待后续补全。
<<stop>>
===

title: ITC_Act5_AfterWork
---
<<set $Sys_CurrentPhase = "AfterWork">>
Narrator: |fade|下班时间。Barks 离开窗口，为下一天做准备。
-> 进入下一天
    <<set $DAY = $DAY + 1>>
    <<set $Sys_CurrentDay = $DAY>>
    <<set $Sys_CurrentPhase = "Contracting">>
    <<jump ITC_Act3_Entry>>
-> 结束当前脚本
    <<jump ITC_End_Demo>>
===

title: ITC_End_Demo
---
Narrator: |fade|当前基础脚本到此结束，可继续扩展客户、结局与阵营分支。
<<stop>>
===
